'''Mega Altaria ex''' (Japanese: '''メガチルタリスex''' ''Mega Tyltalis ex'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

