==Trivia==
*The Immersive card features {{p|Swablu}}, {{p|Altaria}} and Mega Altaria.
===Origin===
*This card features [[Mega]] {{p|Altaria}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Legends: Z-A}}. This made it the first card based on Legends: Z-A; although the game was released only two weeks prior, it was the only one with a Pokédex entry for Mega Altaria, as similarly to [[Mega Blaziken ex (Mega Rising 36)|Mega Blaziken]], it did not receive one in [[Generation VII]].

